q("ht-101", I, 4, HT, "Blocks A and B are in contact as shown and are left for a long time. What will be true at the end?", "Both blocks are at the same temperature, between 40 " + D + " and 90 " + D, [W("A stays at 90 " + D + " and B stays at 40 " + D, "wrong-idea", "Heat flows from A to B until both match."), W("Both blocks are at 40 " + D, "wrong-idea", "A loses heat and B gains it, so they meet in between."), W("Both blocks are at 90 " + D, "wrong-idea", "A loses heat, so it cannot stay at 90 " + D + ".")], ["Heat flows from A to B until they reach one temperature between the two."], lambda: touching("A", "90 " + D, "B", "40 " + D, "Two blocks in contact"))
