q("ht-108", I, 2, HT, "A large bucket and a small cup both hold water at 50 " + D + ". Which statement is correct?", "The bucket has more heat, and both are at the same temperature", [W("The cup has more heat, and both are at the same temperature", "wrong-idea", "More water at the same temperature holds more heat."), W("The bucket is at a higher temperature than the cup", "wrong-idea", "Both are at 50 " + D + "."), W("Both have the same heat and the same temperature", "wrong-idea", "Different amounts of water hold different amounts of heat.")], ["Same temperature, but more water means more heat."], None)
