q("ht-114", I, 1, HT, "Why do our hands become warm when we rub them together?", "Movement energy changes into heat", [W("Our hands take in cold from the air", "wrong-idea", "Cold is not taken in."), W("Heat flows from the cold air to our hands", "reversed", "Heat flows from hot to cold."), W("Our hands lose mass", "wrong-idea", "Mass is not related to heat here.")], ["Rubbing makes friction, which makes heat."], None)
