q("ht-115", I, 4, RD, "A hot metal ball is put into cold water. The graph shows the temperatures of the ball and the water. Which line is for the ball?", "The line that starts at 100 " + D, [W("The line that starts at 20 " + D, "reversed", "The ball is the hot object. It starts at 100 " + D + "."), W("Both lines", "wrong-idea", "The two lines start at different temperatures."), W("Neither line", "wrong-idea", "One of the lines belongs to the ball.")], ["The ball was hotter at the start, so its line starts higher."], BG2)
