q("ht-117", I, 4, RD, "Using the same graph, what is happening to the heat after 8 minutes?", "No heat flows between the ball and the water", [W("Heat still flows from the ball to the water", "wrong-reading", "They are at the same temperature, so there is no net flow."), W("Heat flows from the water to the ball", "wrong-reading", "They are at the same temperature."), W("The ball makes more heat", "wrong-idea", "The ball cannot make heat.")], ["Both have the same temperature, so heat no longer flows."], BG)
